sequenceDiagram
    actor Receptionist
    actor Doctor
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Orch as QueueOrchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Relay as Outbox relay
    Receptionist->>Web: Check in & get token
    Web->>API: PATCH /appointments/:id/check-in with Idempotency-Key
    API->>Orch: checkInAppointment
    Orch->>DB: lock session, next token, INSERT entry waiting, appointment checked_in, event + outbox
    Orch-->>Web: token A-007
    DB-->>Relay: NOTIFY queue_outbox after commit
    Relay-->>Web: queue.event to board and session rooms, screens refetch
    Doctor->>Web: Call next
    Web->>API: POST /queue/sessions/:id/call-next
    API->>Orch: callNext, SelectionEngine picks
    Orch->>DB: entry called, event + outbox
    Orch-->>Web: Calling A-007, TV shows the token
    Doctor->>Web: Patient is here, start
    Web->>API: PATCH /queue/entries/:id/start-consultation with If-Match
    API->>Orch: startConsultation
    Orch->>DB: entry in_consultation, create patient_encounters row
    Orch-->>Web: encounterId, web app opens the consultation workspace
    Doctor->>Web: Complete
    Web->>API: PATCH /queue/entries/:id/complete with If-Match
    API->>Orch: complete
    Orch->>DB: entry completed, appointment completed, charges via ChargeSourcesService
    Orch-->>Web: Visit completed
